<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Robert Mondavi started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Robert Mondavi started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Robert Mondavi Winery with an &quot;outperform&quot; rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Robert Mondavi gained 1-3/8 to 43-1/8.</p>
